# Real-Postgres coverage for SessionRepository.UpdateSessionEndIfStatus
# (#2061): the "WHERE status = $2" compare-and-swap clause -- whether a
# stale-snapshot write is skipped when the row's actual status has already
# moved on -- is enforced by Postgres itself at write time, not by
# application code, so an in-memory fake can't exercise the same guarantee.
# Same tag set/rationale as pending_restart_integration_test above.
#
# Run it explicitly (requires a working Docker daemon):
